2. Voxel 3D Diorama Subsystem (Emerald 3DS / HctrRB Vita Port) — CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
================================================================================

The 3D diorama subsystem under port/src/platform/voxel/ was originally created
by Zallax and Emerald 3DS contributors in ZallaxDev/emerald-3ds (>= 0.5.0),
ported to PS Vita / vitaGL by HctrRB in HctrRB/pokeemerald-vita-3ds, and
further adapted here. It is licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0):

  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

Specifically:
- Derived from ZallaxDev/emerald-3ds (>= 0.5.0) via HctrRB/pokeemerald-vita-3ds
  (vitaGL PS Vita port):
  3ds_field_view.*, voxel_arena.*, voxel_battle.*, voxel_building.*,
  voxel_grade.*, voxel_lighting.*, voxel_regions.*, voxel_relief.*,
  voxel_sign.*, voxel_sprite_slots.*, voxel_swoop.*, voxel_tree.*,
  voxel_tuning.h, voxel_unswizzle.h, and voxel_renderer.c.
- Mixed ancestry (originally derived from MIT-licensed pokeemerald-multiplatform
  scaffolding, rewritten/expanded under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 in ZallaxDev/emerald-3ds
  >= 0.5.0, ported to PS Vita in HctrRB/pokeemerald-vita-3ds under
  CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, and adapted here under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0):
  voxel_world.*, voxel_camera.*, voxel_mesh_builder.*, voxel_atlas.*, and
  voxel_entities.*.

Under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0:
- Attribution: Retain credit to Zallax and Emerald 3DS contributors
  (ZallaxDev/emerald-3ds) AND HctrRB (HctrRB/pokeemerald-vita-3ds), and see
  NOTICE.md.
- NonCommercial: You may not use this material for commercial purposes.
- ShareAlike: If you remix, transform, or build upon this material, you must
  distribute your contributions under the same CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 license.

